  "problem": "Given the graph of $y=f(x),$ we apply the following transformations in the order given:\n\n1\\. Stretch it by a scale factor of $3$ parallel to the $y$-axis\n\n2\\. Translate it to the left by $4$ units\n\n3\\. Stretch it by a scale factor of $\\frac{1}{7}$ parallel to the $x$-axis\n\nWhat is the final function expression after applying all the transformations?",
